"Elias, called the Informant, is an old man who runs the information business on Apex."
"He lives in a brick townhouse facing a grassy square, with a silver-muzzled golden retriever."
"He supplies SkySea Guard with infogear, the island's spy-grade devices."
"An AI-like creation of his, with a soothing male voice, synthesizes his information."
"He says he doesn't hold himself to the System's privacy standards."
"He sells SkySea Guard information on runaway Avowed."
